Linux Mint ARM (unofficial arm64 build of Linux Mint 22.3 "Zena" Cinnamon): virtual machines

What only virtual machines use (the system's first start removes this package on a Raspberry
Pi). Firefox renders in software (/usr/lib/firefox/defaults/pref/mint-arm-vm.js), and
the mint-arm-rosetta service registers Apple's Rosetta for x86-64 Linux programs when the VM
runs under Apple's Virtualization framework with Rosetta sharing enabled.
